{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログを開いてくださり、ありがとうございます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "櫻坂46 三期生 山口県出身🐡 21歳の"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "谷口愛季(たにぐちあいり)です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ーーー Lonesome rabbit ーーー"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202609/mobddKzbD.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202609/mobQ9V7XE.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202609/mobobL9f6.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202609/mobdIVogg.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "Lonesome rabbit オフショットです！！！"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202609/mobswRkSG.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202609/mobF7RDu7.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ニット帽似合う〜！ってたくさん褒めてもらえてとっても嬉しかったです〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ちなみに、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ピンで厳重に止めてるので、落ちたことないです！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この期間は頭を触られる機会が多かった気がする、、、、"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202609/mobaaSXmV.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202609/mobrYESAg.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202609/mobkBn591.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ﾃﾝｻﾝ!!!"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202609/mobOej3h7.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202609/mobtNzm99.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "前髪分け族"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202609/mobaW3sQP.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ニット帽仲間"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202609/mobvNcVdu.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "手のひらで眠る美青"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "かわいいーーー！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーー"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつ出そう、いつ出そうと悩んでいたら"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もう15th Single期間が終わってしまいます、、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そんなの言い訳ですよね、、、。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログ載せるの遅くなってすみません！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "Lonesome rabbit期間は、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "新しいダンスジャンルに挑戦し、かなり苦戦したのですが、その分自分自身のダンスの成長を感じる期間に出来たと思います！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「今日なんか上手くできた！」を積み重ねるのが楽しくて楽しくて、、、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "さらにダンスが好きになりました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "その場に留まらず成長できる人になりたいです！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ーーーーーーーーーーーーーー"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202609/mobHPjWdO.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またねん👋🏻👋🏻"}], "source": "official"}